# One Commons surface (critical)

Do **not** treat demo and trial as two products to deploy.

| Surface | Role |
|---------|------|
| **commons-pto-demo** | The Pavilion app. Riverside sample by default. Brand a prospect with a pack. |
| **commons-pto** | Legacy private host. Do not open new prospects here. |
| **Stone Hill / shmspto** | Separate school product (treasurer git). |

## Sales motion

1. Share the demo: `https://commons-pto-demo.vercel.app/review?code=…`
2. Brand it: `/review?brand=spring-hill` or banner / review “Brand this tour”
3. If they want to continue: unlock private login / live connectors later. That is the “trial,” not a second Vercel project.

## Agent rules

- Ship Pavilion product to **commons-pto-demo** (robert-4220) only unless Rob asks otherwise.
- Add prospect skins in `frontend/lib/crm/trial-packs/` (brand packs).
- Cookie `pavilion_brand` + `/api/demo/brand` switch packs on demo.
- Never `vercel link` this repo to treasurer.
